<!-- stance — the langkah a turn speaks from. A stance PRIMES the moves possible from a position and
     NEVER gates the rest; calling it re-declares the foreground. Each stance reads by everyday
     name, emoji, or Unicode glyph, so this renders whatever spelling the caller wrote. -->

\procedure ~stance(p1:"philosopher poet satirist humorist private")
<span class="lar-stance"><$text text=<<p1>>/></span>
\end
